original site of the mansion house stands an impressive 5 giant hat tipi with majestic views of the Black Mountains. And let&#8217;s not forget the Indian British fusion wedding ceremony that rewrites the wedding-day rule book, the reason for hosting this music filled celebration. Our brief was &#8220;Nothing conventional please!&#8221; and so we obliged.<\/p>\n<p>Their wedding day was full of memories to cherish where the music and dance never stopped. What a wonderful way to start your married life. Congratulations both. Enjoy. G.x.<\/p>\n<p>Eleanor Gail was hired for Full Wedding Co-ordination.<\/p>\n<p>Photographs by kind permission of the bride and broom and taken by the very lovely Jake Morley. Thank you.x.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"awb-gallery-wrapper awb-gallery-wrapper-1 button-span-no\"><div style=\"margin:-5px;--awb-bordersize:0px;\" class=\"fusion-gallery fusion-gallery-container fusion-grid-3 fusion-columns-total-111 fusion-gallery-layout-grid fusion-gallery-1\"><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/ke-lr-1140.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/ke-lr-1140-460x295.jpg\" width=\"460\" height=\"295\" alt=\"\" title=\"ke-lr-1140\" aria-label=\"ke-lr-1140\" class=\"img-responsive wp-image-1025 fusion-gallery-image-size-fixed\"  \/><\/a><\/div><\/div><div style=\"padding:5px;\" class=\"fusion-grid-column fusion-gallery-column fusion-gallery-column-3 hover-type-none\"><div class=\"fusion-gallery-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/ke-lr-1139.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-rel=\"iLightbox[gallery_image_1]\" class=\"fusion-lightbox\" target=\"_self\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=